      "tags": ["flavor", "smalltalk"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "హల్చల్ (halchal, Urdu) = commotion, buzz, what's-going-on. ఏం హల్చల్? is the Hyderabadi version of standard ఏం విశేషాలు? — భయ్ is Urdu bhai, 'brother'.",
      "distractors": ["u49-i12", "u49-i08"]
    },
    {
      "id": "u49-i08",
      "te": "సిటీలో ఫుల్ హల్చల్ ఉంది.",
      "gloss": "There's full commotion in the city.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "సిటీలో", "gloss": "in the city" },
        { "te": "ఫుల్", "gloss": "full / a lot of" },
        { "te": "హల్చల్", "gloss": "commotion / buzz" },
        { "te": "ఉంది", "gloss": "there is" }
      ],
      "tags": ["flavor", "smalltalk"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "ఫుల్ (full) is the Hyderabadi intensifier for everything — standard Telugu would say చాలా or పూర్తిగా."
    },
    {
      "id": "u49-i09",
      "te": "హౌ కదా మరి!",
      "gloss": "Yes, obviously!",
      "words": [
