      "tags": ["flavor", "pride"],
      "difficulty": 3,
      "note": "వేరే లెవెల్ ('another level') is high praise in Hyderabadi — English words dropped into Telugu is completely normal here."
    },
    {
      "id": "u49-i14",
      "te": "అరే యార్, లేట్ అయింది.",
      "gloss": "Oh yaar, it got late.",
      "words": [
        { "te": "అరే", "gloss": "oh / hey" },
        { "te": "యార్", "gloss": "yaar (friend, Urdu)" },
        { "te": "లేట్", "gloss": "late" },
